<title>USA: Central Newspapers Inc Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Central Newspapers Inc Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(unaudited) (000's omitted except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						   THIRTEEN WEEKS ENDED</p>
<p>						     Mar 30,     Mar 31,</p>
<p>							  1997	 1996</p>
<p>OPERATING REVENUES:</p>
<p>   Advertising				  $128,996    $112,504</p>
<p>   Circulation				    35,554	34,270</p>
