<p>OUTSTANDING (combined Class A and</p>
<p>  equivalent Class B shares)		  26,394	26,700</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Net income before special charges (work force reduction and/or building impairment costs) was $21.2 million, or $0.81 per share, and $11.8 million, or $0.44 per share, in first quarters of 1997 and 1996, respectively. (1) Amounts include $2.4 million in 1997 five-week period and $6.6 million in 1997 year-to-date period of revenues from acquisition of the Westech group of companies, which occurred February 1997. 1997 year-to-date period also includes $2.8 million of revenues from McCormick and Co Inc for January and February 1997. McCormick not owned in January and February of 1996.</p>
